Results Summary
---------------
Best optimizer: Lion (loss: 8.2268) - sign-based, Google 2023
Second: AdamW (loss: 8.2643) - baseline, proven reliability
Third: Adafactor (loss: 8.2693) - memory-efficient
Fourth: Prodigy (loss: 8.3102) - parameter-free, no LR tuning needed
Fifth: Muon (loss: 8.3671) - SOTA Dec 2024, SVD-based
Sixth: RAdam (loss: 8.4416) - rectified Adam

Failed to converge: Sophia, Adan, SF-AdamW, D-Adam (NaN losses)

Model architecture: 4 layers x 256 hidden x 4 heads (~4.2M params)
Training: 2 epochs, batch size 16, learning rate range 1e-5 to 1e-3
5 trials per optimizer with Optuna TPE + MedianPruner